# ♻️ Pre-Commit Hook — Executes before each `git commit`. <Last updated: 2025-10-20>
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📘 This hook helps catch issues early by running essential checks.
# ❗ If any command fails, the commit will be aborted.
# 🚫 To bypass the hook (not recommended), run: `git commit --no-verify`.

# Lint code for errors and style violations
pnpm lint

# Automatically format code using Prettier rules
pnpm format
